12:["$","section",null,{"className":"mb-12","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"mb-5 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-950 dark:text-white","children":"常见问题"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","details","浏览器 PDF 工具能处理私密文档吗？",{"className":"border-b border-slate-200 py-4 dark:border-slate-800","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"cursor-pointer text-base font-semibold text-slate-950 dark:text-white","children":"浏览器 PDF 工具能处理私密文档吗？"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300","children":"当操作在浏览器本地运行时它们更安全。用户仍然应避免将机密文档上传到未知服务，并通过浏览器开发者工具验证每个工具的网络行为。"}]]}],["$","details","网站图片的最佳格式是什么？",{"className":"border-b border-slate-200 py-4 dark:border-slate-800","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"cursor-pointer text-base font-semibold text-slate-950 dark:text-white","children":"网站图片的最佳格式是什么？"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300","children":"WebP 是许多网页图片的实用默认选择，SVG 最适合矢量图形，PNG 最适合透明背景和截图，JPEG 在兼容性重要时仍适用于照片。最佳格式是在对特定内容类型不明显降低质量的前提下，文件大小最小的格式。"}]]}],["$","details","应该先压缩还是先裁剪图片？",{"className":"border-b border-slate-200 py-4 dark:border-slate-800","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"cursor-pointer text-base font-semibold text-slate-950 dark:text-white","children":"应该先压缩还是先裁剪图片？"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300","children":"先裁剪并调整尺寸，再压缩。在压缩之前移除不必要的像素通常能产生更好的结果，文件更小。"}]]}],["$","details","可以合并不同页面尺寸的 PDF 吗？",{"className":"border-b border-slate-200 py-4 dark:border-slate-800","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"cursor-pointer text-base font-semibold text-slate-950 dark:text-white","children":"可以合并不同页面尺寸的 PDF 吗？"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300","children":"可以，但要仔细检查输出。混合 A4 和 Letter 纸张尺寸，或混合纵向和横向页面，可能产生尴尬的结果。在合并之前尽量统一页面尺寸和方向。"}]]}],["$","details","为什么我的 SVG 转成 PNG 后看起来不一样了？",{"className":"border-b border-slate-200 py-4 dark:border-slate-800","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"cursor-pointer text-base font-semibold text-slate-950 dark:text-white","children":"为什么我的 SVG 转成 PNG 后看起来不一样了？"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300","children":"SVG 的渲染取决于渲染引擎，字体、滤镜和复杂渐变可能无法完美转换。在高分辨率下转换，检查输出，在保真度重要时在转换前简化复杂 SVG。"}]]}],["$","details","Base64 嵌入比外链图片更好吗？",{"className":"border-b border-slate-200 py-4 dark:border-slate-800","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"cursor-pointer text-base font-semibold text-slate-950 dark:text-white","children":"Base64 嵌入比外链图片更好吗？"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300","children":"Base64 嵌入减少了一个 HTTP 请求，但增加了 HTML 大小并阻止浏览器缓存。仅建议对非常小的图片（1-2 KB 以下）使用，这种情况下请求开销大于缓存收益。对于大多数图片，使用带良好缓存头的外部文件链接更高效。"}]]}]]}]]}]
13:["$","footer",null,{"className":"border-t border-slate-200 pt-5 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 dark:border-slate-800 dark:text-slate-300","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"flex items-start gap-2","children":[["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle-check mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-blue-600","aria-hidden":"true","children":[["$","circle","1mglay",{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"}],["$","path","dzmm74",{"d":"m9 12 2 2 4-4"}],"$undefined"]}],"由 ToolOrbit 编辑团队维护。本页面链接到实用工具和配套指南，帮助读者验证具体工作流，而不是依赖笼统说法。"]}],["$","$L1f",null,{"href":"/authors/toolorbit-editorial-team","className":"mt-3 inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-300","children":["编辑团队资料"," ",["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-external-link h-4 w-4","aria-hidden":"true","children":[["$","path","1q9fwt",{"d":"M15 3h6v6"}],["$","path","gplh6r",{"d":"M10 14 21 3"}],["$","path","a6xqqp",{"d":"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"}],"$undefined"]}]]}]]}]
